{
    "background_story": "In the mystical realm of Aethoria, Muggles was a revered dragon known for his unique connection to the sacrum, a sacred site where ancient magic dwelled. Legends spoke of Muggles' ability to harness the sacrum's energy, using it to heal the land and its creatures. As a guardian of the sacrum, Muggles spent his days meditating within the site's crystal caves, absorbing the mystical forces that flowed through it. His wisdom and power grew with each passing year, earning him the respect and admiration of Aethoria's inhabitants. When a dark sorcerer threatened to desecrate the sacrum, Muggles unleashed his fury, summoning a maelstrom of sacred energy to defend the site and restore balance to the realm. From that day on, Muggles was hailed as a hero, his name synonymous with bravery and devotion to the sacrum.",
